    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "overlapsWithSentence";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "A person serving a sentence that overlaps with the sentence imposed for a federal offence is also under sentence in relation to a prescribed offence or serious offence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(f) is subject to an order made under Division 9 of Part 1B;";
